<root>
	<styles>
		<include src="s2r://panorama/styles/custom_game/hud_shared.vcss_c" />
		<include src="s2r://panorama/styles/custom_game/reservedslots_hud.vcss_c" />
	</styles>

	<!--
		ReservedSlots HUD - one private red card for the player about to be kicked, lower middle
		(top 640), under the crosshair. The same card as AFKManager's countdown (afk_hud), in red.

		  A reserved player joined   "Reserved slot / A VIP joined a full server / You are the one
		                             leaving. Thanks for playing.", a big countdown and a 2px bar
		                             draining over it, for the plugin's kick delay
		  The server is full         the same card for a joining player turned away
		                             (both were env_instructor_hint captions before)

		The number pops once a second in the last 3. The kick itself ends the card: the player is gone.

		NOT INTERACTIVE. hittest false everywhere; the plugin opens it with CaptureInput = false.

		CONTRACT (src/ReservedSlots/Hud/KickHud.cs must match)
		  RootPanelId  = "ReservedSlotsRoot"   RevealClass = "show"   RowCount = 0
		  CaptureInput = false                 HideHud = None         SharedText = false

		The root is full-screen and carries nothing visible itself; it is opened once per player and
		stays open. The card has its own "show", and "hidden" (collapse) while it is not in use.

		DIALOG VARIABLES
		  rs_eyebrow rs_title rs_sub rs_n

		CLASSES THE SERVER TOGGLES
		  rs_card   show hidden
		  rs_n      pop-a pop-b                     (ping-pong, once a second in the last 3)
		  rs_bar    at-0..at-20                     where the bar starts, in 5% steps (at-20 = full)
		            dur-1..dur-60, dur-65..dur-180  how long it drains for (5s steps above 60)
		            run                             drain to 0, one linear clip transition
	-->
	<Panel class="hud-screen" hittest="false">
		<Panel id="ReservedSlotsRoot" class="rs-root" hittest="false">

			<Panel id="rs_card" class="rs hidden" hittest="false">
				<Panel class="rs-row" hittest="false">
					<Panel class="rs-icon" hittest="false" />
					<Panel class="rs-main" hittest="false">
						<Label class="rs-eyebrow" hittest="false" text="{s:rs_eyebrow}" />
						<Label class="rs-title" hittest="false" text="{s:rs_title}" />
						<Label class="rs-sub" hittest="false" text="{s:rs_sub}" />
					</Panel>
					<Panel class="rs-num" hittest="false">
						<Label id="rs_n" class="rs-n" hittest="false" text="{s:rs_n}" />
						<Label class="rs-s" hittest="false" text="s" />
					</Panel>
				</Panel>
				<Panel class="rs-track" hittest="false">
					<Panel id="rs_bar" class="rs-bar" hittest="false" />
				</Panel>
			</Panel>

		</Panel>
	</Panel>
</root>
